 🎓 AI-Powered Tamil Nadu College Finder

 📌 Project Overview

The AI-Powered Tamil Nadu College Finder is an AI-based application that helps students discover suitable colleges, courses, and scholarship opportunities across Tamil Nadu.

Users can enter their preferred domain, select a city, and choose their college preferences to receive personalized college recommendations with relevant course details, scholarship information, and college website links.

 ✨ Features

- 🎓 AI-powered college recommendations
- 📍 Search colleges by city across Tamil Nadu
- 📚 Find relevant courses based on the preferred domain
- 💰 Explore scholarship opportunities and eligibility details
- 🔗 Access college websites and admission links
- ➕ Retrieve additional college recommendations
- 🖥️ Interactive web interface using Streamlit

 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- OpenRouter API
- OpenAI Python SDK
- JSON

📂 Project Structure


TAMILNADU COLLEGE FINDER/
│
├── college.py
├── needs.txt
└── README.md


⚙️ Installation and Setup

 1. Clone the Repository

GitHub Repository: [AI-PROJECTS](https://github.com/MIRUTHULASRI-24/AI-PROJECTS)


2. Navigate to the Project Folder


cd "AI-PROJECTS/TAMILNADU COLLEGE FINDER"

 3. Install Dependencies


pip install -r needs.txt


4. Configure the API Key

This application uses the OpenRouter API to generate AI-powered recommendations.

- Create an OpenRouter API key.
- Store it securely using Streamlit secrets or an environment variable.
- Never upload your API key to GitHub.

5. Run the Application


streamlit run college.py


The application will open in your web browser.

🚀 How to Use

1. Enter a preferred domain, such as Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Computer Science, or Data Science.
2. Select a preferred city in Tamil Nadu or choose any city in Tamil Nadu.
3. Choose your college preference.
4. Click **Find Top 5 Colleges with Scholarships**.
5. Explore college recommendations, courses, scholarship information, and website links.
6. Click **View More Colleges** to retrieve additional recommendations.

🎯 Project Objective

The objective of this project is to simplify the college-search process by helping students explore institutions, identify relevant courses, and discover potential scholarship opportunities through an AI-powered interface.

⚠️ Disclaimer

Recommendations and scholarship details are AI-generated and may not always be accurate or current. Always verify college information, course availability, admission procedures, scholarship eligibility, and deadlines through official sources.

